      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transport from Noida</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Relocating a two-wheeler from Noida to Kanpur via road transport is a straightforward process, provided that the vehicle documentation is meticulously organized. Because both cities fall within the state of Uttar Pradesh, the logistics are streamlined, but strict adherence to legal and insurance requirements remains paramount to avoid transit disputes or legal complications.</p>
<p>Before dispatching your bike, ensure that you have gathered the specific paperwork mandated by the transport provider and regulatory authorities.</p>

<p>First and foremost, a self-attested photocopy of the Register Certificate (RC) is essential. This document verifies the legal ownership of the vehicle. It must be clearly legible, with your signature and date affixed, confirming that the details match the physical vehicle.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Alongside the RC, you must present a current Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>While the bike is not being driven to the destination, a valid PUC certifies that the vehicle met emission standards recently, which is a standard compliance requirement for many transport agencies to ensure the vehicle is in roadworthy condition at the time of handover.</span></li></ul>

<p>Equally critical is the valid insurance certificate. You must hold active comprehensive insurance for the duration of the transit. Furthermore, you must secure an IBA-approved consignment bilty.</p>
<p>This is the primary legal contract between you and the transporter, detailing the route, the vehicle description, and the agreed-upon delivery timeline. Without a properly executed bilty, the transport company is not legally liable for any loss or damage that occurs during the journey.</p>

<p>Finally, the cornerstone of a secure bike relocation is 100% declared-value marine transit insurance. This specialized coverage is distinct from your standard personal motor insurance, as it specifically protects the asset while in the custody of the logistics provider.</p>
<p>By opting for full declared-value coverage, you ensure that if the bike is damaged, stolen, or destroyed during transit, you are reimbursed for the full market value you declared. This eliminates financial risk and guarantees peace of mind.</p>

